{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.s5_bring_hodge_depth","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.s5_bring_hodge_depth","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Rat.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.multiplicity_W_in_H1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.multiplicity_W_in_H1","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/s5_bring_hodge_depth.lean#L82-L85","doc":"**`W` occurs in `H¹ = 2·W` with multiplicity 2:** `⟨χ_{H¹}, χ_W⟩ = 2`.\nThis is the Schur bound `depth ≤ 2` on the `S₅`-equivariant Gauss–Manin\nrecurrence (modulo the cited Riera–Rodríguez identification `H⁰(Ω) ≅ W`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.W41_W2111_distinct","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.W41_W2111_distinct","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/s5_bring_hodge_depth.lean#L79-L80","doc":"**`(4,1)` and `(2,1,1,1)` are distinct irreducibles:** `⟨χ_(4,1), χ_(2,1,1,1)⟩ = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.W2111_irreducible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.W2111_irreducible","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/s5_bring_hodge_depth.lean#L76-L77","doc":"**The sign-twist `(2,1,1,1)` is irreducible:** `⟨χ, χ⟩ = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.W41_irreducible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.W41_irreducible","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/s5_bring_hodge_depth.lean#L73-L74","doc":"**The standard rep `W = (4,1)` is irreducible:** `⟨χ_W, χ_W⟩ = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.chiH1_eq_two_chiW41","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.chiH1_eq_two_chiW41","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/s5_bring_hodge_depth.lean#L69-L71","doc":"`chiH1` is `2 · chiW41` entrywise (`H¹ = 2·W`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.chiW2111_eq_twist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.chiW2111_eq_twist","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/s5_bring_hodge_depth.lean#L65-L67","doc":"`sgn` twists `chiW41` into `chiW2111` entrywise (bookkeeping check). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.inner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.inner","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/s5_bring_hodge_depth.lean#L60-L63","doc":"The `S₅` class-function inner product\n`⟨a, b⟩ = (1/|S₅|) Σ_classes |C|·a(C)·b(C)` (real characters). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.chiH1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.chiH1","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/s5_bring_hodge_depth.lean#L57-L58","doc":"Character of `H¹ = W ⊕ conj W = 2·W` (`W` is real, so `conj W ≅ W`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.chiW2111","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.chiW2111","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/s5_bring_hodge_depth.lean#L53-L55","doc":"Character of the sign-twist `(2,1,1,1) = (4,1) ⊗ sgn`\n(`= [4, -2, 0, 1, 1, 0, -1]`, i.e. `chiW41` times `sgn` entrywise). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.chiW41","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.chiW41","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/s5_bring_hodge_depth.lean#L49-L51","doc":"Character of the standard representation `W = (4,1)`:\n`χ(g) = (# fixed points of g) − 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.sgn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.sgn","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/s5_bring_hodge_depth.lean#L46-L47","doc":"The sign character of `S₅` on the 7 classes (parity of a representative). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.classSizes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.S5BringHodgeDepth.classSizes","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ArchimedeanUniverse/s5_bring_hodge_depth.lean#L42-L44","doc":"Conjugacy-class sizes of `S₅` on its 7 classes\n`e, (12), (12)(34), (123), (123)(45), (1234), (12345)` (sum `= 120 = |S₅|`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}